title: Psalm 48: Beautiful for Situation, Mount Zion
description: Psalm 48 in the King James Bible: mount Zion, the city of the great King, Sennacherib and Hezekiah, Zion holy because God chose it, Jerusalem as the bride, the promise to Abraham and his seed which is Christ, political Zionism and the spirit of Esau, and the kings that marvelled and hasted away, from the Psalms series study.
output: lessons/bible/psalm-48.html
context: Psalm 48

